@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>SkillSnap</h1>

<p>
    SkillSnap is a portfolio app created as part of the Microsoft Full-Stack Developer Certification.
    Create an account, build your profile, and showcase your bio, skills, and projects. Browse profiles
    to discover what other members are working on.
</p>

<p>
    Built with Blazor WebAssembly and ASP.NET Core, SkillSnap uses Entity Framework Core with SQLite
    for data storage and ASP.NET Core Identity with JWT for authentication.
</p>

